WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.422
The project asks you to design a small analytics layer for three needs.

00:00:04.422 --> 00:00:09.337
Employee performance is stable shared logic and fits a standard view.

00:00:09.337 --> 00:00:17.447
Recent customer activity can be a shared view, while the at-risk threshold remains in a CTE because it

00:00:17.447 --> 00:00:17.812
may vary by report.

00:00:17.812 --> 00:00:25.322
The diagnosis dashboard uses a repeated summary and can use a materialized view when a refresh delay is

00:00:25.322 --> 00:00:29.297
acceptable. Choose the smallest reusable object that matches the need.

00:00:29.297 --> 00:00:34.427
A CTE is local to one query, a view centralizes live logic,

00:00:34.427 --> 00:00:37.622
and a materialized view persists a snapshot.

00:00:37.622 --> 00:00:43.162
Promote logic into shared objects when it is stable, reused, and worth governing as part of the analytical

00:00:43.162 --> 00:00:44.909
architecture.
